          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo kucikalilo cabafwa, mbwaakali amapenzibulanga, wakatambya meso aakwe, wabona Abrahamu kulaale, awalo Lazaro acamba cakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndilyonya wakoompolola ejwi pati wati, Taata Abrahamu, ndifwida luzyalo, utume Lazaro kuti atompe mpela yamunwe wakwe mumaanzi, azootontozye mulaka wangu, nkaambo ndapengesya mumabangabanga aya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pele Abrahamu wakateeti, Mwana, koyeeya kuti wakalitambwide zibotu zyako nowakali muumi, mbubonya Lazaro mbwaakatambwide zibi. Eno muno walyokezya, pele yebo wapengesya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
